shutdown, and is  intended  for  configuring  GPIO  pins.   Lines
starting  with  a  hash  and  empty lines are ignored.  If a line
starts with the rest of line will get evaluated as  shell  script
fragment.   All  other lines are passed to The configuration file
resides in script that parses In this example, if the config file
is present pin 1 of is set as output and  named  "error_led".   #
